{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-wechat-queue#card-zh","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-wechat-queue","commit":"29713fa023b906760f74454e219aa538c3d7b052","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wechat-queue 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的微信 iLink 通道插件。它通过 Cordis 补丁装配到 DSH，提供扫码登录面板，并把微信消息写入本地持久队列后逐条交给 agent；每轮完成后再发送完整回复。它还支持微信内的停止、状态、帮助和新会话命令，转发 DSH 命令，收发图片、文件和视频，并在处理时显示输入状态。适合希望从微信与 DSH agent 对话、并保留未处理消息的用户；需要 DSH 环境和微信登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214","lib/queue/worker.js:243","lib/bridge/commands.js:28","lib/media.js:31"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-wechat-queue#card-en","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-wechat-queue","commit":"29713fa023b906760f74454e219aa538c3d7b052","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wechat-queue connects WeChat to DSH with QR login. It stores messages locally, processes them in order, and sends completed replies. Users can stop turns, check queue status, start chats, forward DSH commands, and exchange media. Chat with a DSH agent from WeChat. Requires DSH and WeChat login.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214","lib/queue/worker.js:243","lib/bridge/commands.js:28","lib/media.js:31"]}
